<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n72586" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶνοψ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οπος</span>, ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄψ</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wine-coloured,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> (never in nom.) epith. of the sea, <i>wine-dark,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.316
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				5.132
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.421
			</span></i> ; of oxen, <i>wine-red, deep-red,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βόε οἴνοπε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					13.703
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				13.32
			</span></i> ; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰ. Βάκχος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.44
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νύμφη οἴνοπα πῆχυν ἀνεῖλκε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Tryph.
					521
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
